  "sourceTitle": "Peanut Butter And Chocolate Oatmeal",
  "sourceText": "Peanut Butter And Chocolate Oatmeal\nBy: Active Foodie\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 10:15pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n cup quick cooking oats\n1 teaspoon unsweetened cocoa\n1 teaspoon agave\n1 tablespoon organic crunchy peanut butter\n1/2 cup non-fat milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Microwave all ingredients in a small bowl or mug for 1 minute, stir and enjoy!  Serve with crushed peanuts or almonds for some extra crunch!",
